<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Digital cut by SoundView.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Digital cut by SoundView.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial said it downgraded Digital Equipment Corp to short-term hold from buy and maintained its long-term hold rating.</p>
<p>-- SoundView said it cut its fiscal 1997 share earnings estimate on Digital to $3.25 from $3.38.</p>
<p>-- The stock lost 2-1/8 to 37-3/4.</p>
</text>
